 delete legacy paths until new pipeline is proven end-to-end.\n- Follow project AGENTS.md and OMX team protocol.\n\n## Unknowns / open questions\n- Exact current code seams most suitable for first-wave modifications may differ from the approved ideal architecture.\n- Worker progress may reveal dependency conflicts between current code structure and planned boundaries.\n- Legacy overlapping paths may need later cleanup beyond first-wave execution.\n\n## Likely codebase touchpoints\n- `FamilyTodo/Sync/**` (new)\n- `FamilyTodo/Models/**`\n- `FamilyTodo/Managers/CloudKitManager.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/Managers/CloudKitSubscriptionManager.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/Services/NotificationService.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/Services/HouseholdSyncCoordinator.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/Services/AppDelegateBridge.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/FamilyTodoApp.swift`\n- `FamilyTodo/Stores/**`\n- `FamilyTodoTests/**`\n\n## Initial staffing intent\nUse 3 executor workers to cover:\n1. Data + outbox foundation\n2. Transport + inbound reconciliation\n3. Runtime + classification/feedback scaffolding\nEOF\nprintf '%s\\n' \"$path\"","workdir":"/home/wkochanowski/code/family-todo","yield_time_ms":1000,"max_output_tokens":2000} thread_id=019d54f6-3a11-7b82-a72e-048a37658b6a
